Files: restic/*
Copyright: 2014 Alexander Neumann and restic contributors
License: BSD-2-Clause
Comment: Official upstream release binaries from
 https://github.com/restic/restic/releases, bundled because backrest pins a
 restic version newer than the one in Debian. Checksums are recorded in
 debian/restic.sha256sums.

Files: vendor/* webui/dist/*
Copyright: (varies per vendored Go module / bundled npm package)
License: (varies per vendored Go module / bundled npm package)
Comment: This stanza is a placeholder. vendor/ (go mod vendor) and
 webui/dist/ (vite build of webui/, which bundles npm dependencies) are
 generated by debian/prepare-source.sh immediately before building the
 source package and are not present in the upstream git tree. Before the
 first upload, run `licensecheck -r vendor/` and inspect
 webui/node_modules licenses (e.g. `npx license-checker --production`), then
 replace this stanza with one Files: entry per distinct license found.

